== a model the engine does not run, no Python tool
glyd: Qwen2.5-0.5B is a Qwen2ForCausalLM model, and this engine runs Qwen3 models so far.
  Other models run with the vLLM-based glyd: pip install "glyd[vllm]" (https://getglyd.com)
exit 3
== a name the Hub does not know
glyd: the Hugging Face Hub would not show no/such-model-xyz: the name is wrong, or it is a gated or private model.
  Check the name (ORG/NAME, as in Qwen/Qwen3-8B). For a gated model (Llama, Gemma), accept its licence at https://huggingface.co/no/such-model-xyz, then run: glyd login   (it takes a token from https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens)
